id: tp-04-sundered
number: 104
name: Sundered
pool: Hard
description: Two halves joined by one tile at the far end, with an Anchor sitting on it. Each pair faces the problem the other pair solves.
design: Board topology 4 — the two players are the ones who get split.
design: A pit column runs the full height except the top tile (5,0), which an Anchor is standing on. Player A owns the west half, Player B the east, and each half holds the enemy the other player was built to answer.
retired: Duplicates `as-08-two-fires`; the Anchor on the link is inert and the fight ends in four rounds.

spawn n = Anchor
spawn h = Husk
spawn g = Grappler
spawn l = Lobber
spawn s = Stalker

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

